event.schema.json is copied unmodified from the Personal Agent Protocol
project, https://github.com/personal-agent-protocol/personal-agent-protocol,
and is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this
directory). It describes one conversation event (PAP 1.0, sections 8.5, 8.7,
8.10 and 8.11). The event field names used in ../reader.go follow it.

Its "$ref" to message.schema.json refers to a sibling schema in that project,
which is not vendored here.
